<title>USA: First Investor 5.73pct stake held by group.</title>
<headline>First Investor 5.73pct stake held by group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including JAM Partners LP said Monday it holds 319,200 shares or a 5.73 percent stake in First Investors Financial Services Group Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it most recently acquired 78,200 shares between Jan. 27 and April 4 at $6.81 to $8.12 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds shares in the Houston-based company for investment purposes only.</p>
